-*   **Outputs:** Final color ($destColor$) and opacity ($remainOpacity$) for each pixel/fragment [S2].
+*   **Outputs:** Final color ($destColor$) and accumulated transparency ($remainOpacity$) for each pixel/fragment [S2].
 
 **Data Structures:**
-*   **3D Texture:** Stores the scalar volume data. Access is performed via `texture3D(dataSetTexture, pos)` [S2].
-*   **1D Texture:** Stores the transfer function mapping scalar values to color and opacity. Access is performed via `texture1D(opacityTexture, scalar)` [S2].
+*   **3D Texture:** Stores the scalar volume data [S2].
